# Spinner - a loading mark for a button or a line, never for a whole screen (that is a Skeleton).
#   Btn(onClick: save) disabled… { Spinner()  Span "Guardando…" }
# shadcn-for-muten · part · no deps · Nova (.cn-spinner).
part Spinner() { Icon "lucide:loader-circle" class("cn-spinner animate-spin") aria(label: "Cargando", role: "status") }
